# Control case for mqttshape:ReasonCodeNotAllowedInPacketType.
# Reason Code 0x8E (Session taken over) is listed in Table 2-6 for DISCONNECT
# only. Here a CONNACK carries it, which no reasoner can detect: the packet
# types are an annotation in mqtt.ttl, not an axiom.

@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix MQTT: <http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/MQTT#> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/mqtt-fixture-reason-code#> .

ex:Connack_Bad rdf:type MQTT:Connack ;
    MQTT:hasReasonCode MQTT:ReasonCodeSessionTakenOver .
